new file mode 100644
index 0000000..66f1fde
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70200.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Added a ``min`` threshold option to the ``diskusage`` beacon, alongside the existing ``max``
+threshold, to alert when a mount's usage unexpectedly drops (typically a sign the filesystem
+failed to mount). Existing plain-percentage configuration for the high-usage alert continues
+to work unchanged.
